{"id":26,"titleZh":"保罗·欣德米特的天才","titleEn":"The Genius of Paul Hindemith","date":"1964-02-23","dateZh":"1964 年 2 月 23 日","concepts":"调性根基 vs. 无调性、交叉关系、现代和声改编","thesis":"当年被误骂为“疯狂无调性分子”的欣德米特，骨子里其实是巴赫与海顿的纯正传人，只是替严谨传统换了套现代和声。","plain":"针对不久前辞世的德国大师欣德米特，伯恩斯坦先纠正大众对“无调性”的误解：无调性意味着没有中心音，欣德米特恰恰坚守中心调性。听起来刺耳的音符，拆开看只是在老式进行曲与赋格基础上多添了冲突的交叉和声。","scenes":["伯恩斯坦在钢琴上逐段对比，先弹欣德米特《第二钢琴奏鸣曲》现代感十足的开头，指出左手明明是海顿和莫扎特常用的老式伴奏，接着现场把现代冲突音改回传统和弦，一秒还原成旧式德国民谣对照。","由弦乐四重奏演《第三四重奏》证明其内含两个温柔调性的叠合，最后结合祭坛画故事完整解读交响曲《画家马蒂斯》。"],"category":"大师与杰作","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1pT4y1w7f6","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pT4y1w7f6","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 保罗·欣德米特的天才","duration":"54:03","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/the-genius-of-paul-hindemith","repertoire":[{"composer":"Hindemith","piece":"String Quartet No. 3, Op. 22","titleZh":"第三弦乐四重奏","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music/54/82/87/mzm.rfeqnrya.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/string-quartet-no-3-op-22-i-fugato-sehr-langsame-viertel/215813847?i=215814352&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Brandis Quartett","recordingTrack":"String Quartet No. 3, Op. 22: I. Fugato. Sehr Langsame Viertel","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Hindemith%20String%20Quartet%20No.%203%2C%20Op.%2022+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Hindemith%20String%20Quartet%20No.%203%2C%20Op.%2022"},{"composer":"Hindemith","piece":"Kleine Kammermusik, Op. 24, No. 2 (1st Movement)","titleZh":"小室内乐第一乐章","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music/c8/aa/40/mzi.olnqicce.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/kleine-kammermusik-op-24-no-2-iv-schnelle-viertel/528023484?i=528023635&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Swiss Woodwind Quintet","recordingTrack":"Kleine Kammermusik, Op. 24, No. 2: IV. Schnelle Viertel","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/result